					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Honestly, it was the names Ed and Al that tipped me off to the FMA reference, that is Ed and Al Elrich from the FMA series. You're dead right about the alchemy mythology though, no doubt both parties dipped hardily into that folklore for inspiration. My brain just tends to immediately go to anime being the geek that I am ;-P</p> 
