					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-3936646#post-3609674</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-3936646/herman-fuller-presents:the-amazing-zoltan#post-3609674</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sun, 08 Oct 2017 12:28:06 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>dankaar</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1790336</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>The <a href="https://en.m.wikipedia.org/wiki/Philosopher's_stone">Philosopher's Stone</a> is a mythical alchemical creation, not unique to Fullmetal Alchemist. In fact, FMA got it from the real-world myths surrounding the Philosopher's Stone.</p> <p>I think that, in this scenario, the author was just drinking from the same well as FMA.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
